Three commits, one per fix, all on branch `fix/tables-analytics-seo`:

---

**BUG-WEB-006** (`a8a47c0`): Deleted the stale hardcoded `.ds-table` block from `ds-marketing.css` (33 lines). Carried over three missing selectors into `marketing-pages-extra.css`:

| Property | Old block had | Token block was missing |
|---|---|---|
| `.ds-table .full` | `color:var(--do-text-secondary)` | Yes — carried over |
| `.ds-table .full .price` | `color:var(--do-text-primary)` | Yes — carried over |
| `.ds-table .dash` | `color:var(--do-text-secondary)` | Yes — carried over |

Added `min-width:180px` on `.ds-table th:first-child` for product-label breathing room. Added mobile scroll hint (`Scroll to see the full table →`) on `.table-wrap` matching the `.plate-scroll::after` pattern.

**BUG-WEB-007** (`00b1982`): Added `https://*.analytics.google.com` and `https://stats.g.doubleclick.net` to CSP `connect-src` in `next.config.ts`. No other directives touched.

**BUG-WEB-008** (`e79c1a8`): Deleted `app/decoded-method/page.tsx` and directory. Added permanent redirect `/decoded-method` → `/resources/decoded-method` in `next.config.ts`. Updated Header (line 70), Footer (line 67), and `process-quality-system` (line 158) links. Removed `/decoded-method` from sitemap; `/resources/decoded-method` remains.
